learningOutcomes:
FINANCE AND BANKING 
PROGRAM OBJECTIVES 
PLO1: Demonstrate knowledge of and proficiency in the terminology, theories, concepts, 
practices and skills specific to the field of economics and management; 
PLO2: Demonstrate knowledge and proficiency for professional work and/or further learning; 
PLO3: Exhibit competency in applying social skills to work effectively in a multidisciplinary 
managerial group and in an international environment; 
PLO4: Exhibit competency in applying the knowledge and reasoning skills to produce creative 
economic and business solutions in the situation of globalization, knowledge economy, and 
increasingly competitive environment; 
PLO5: Demonstrate autonomy, well-developed judgement of knowledge and responsibility, 
qualified in health.
